Imported from surface.vtk
Raw reconstruction has topological problems.  Fixed by:
Generate Macaque.M132.L.FIDUCIAL_CORRECTED.54616.coord
 from Macaque.M132.L.FIDUCIAL.54616.coord using correct fiducial surface topology (correct handles):Macaque.M132.L.CLOSED_CORRECTED.54616.topo.  This fixes topology, but some fiducial surface links don't look right.  Opened raw surface using new topology, repeated 10 iters smoothing, and results look great, but coord values are slightly different.
 (dve/jh 22mar11)]]></Value>
